# Concurrent agent edits

Before editing, pick one lane from `ARCHITECTURE.md` and stay there.

- **Domain** → `src/core/**` only
- **Play 3D board** → `MazeWorld` play-floor / materials — not win gallery or playHud
- **Home / enter-play** → `homeTower.ts`, `enterPlay*`, `playCamera.ts`
- **Win gallery** → `winGalleryKit.ts`, `winGalleryScenes.ts`
- **Play HUD** → `src/render/hud/**` (homeMenu / startGate / playStats / fx)
- **DOM UI** → `src/ui/**` + kit; kit CSS → one of `buttons` / `shell` / `forms`
- **Editor** → `editor*.ts`, `editorBoardDom.ts`, `editorHistory` / `Drafts` / `Physics`, `editor.module.css`
- **Campaign / routing** → `campaignSession.ts`, `appRouting.ts`, `shellMenus.ts`, `route.ts`, minimal App wiring

Never grow `App.ts`, `MazeWorld.ts`, `editor.ts`, or `playHud.ts` by large new features — extract a sibling module first.

Shared controls: only add to `src/ui/kit/`. Game rules: only add to `src/core/`.

After changes: `npm run typecheck` and `npm test` (Node 22+).
